sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Archi A
    participant S as Quarkus
    participant DB as Neo4j
    participant K as Kafka
    participant B as Archi B
    A->>A: Persist batch in FIFO outbox
    A->>S: SubmitOps (batch ID, base, ops)
    S->>S: Authorize, deduplicate, validate<br/>Assign revision range
    S->>DB: One transaction: log, projection,<br/>head and publication intent
    DB-->>S: Commit succeeds
    par Private acceptance
      S-->>A: OpsAccepted (ID and range)
      A->>A: Remove matching outbox entry
    and Durable publication
      S->>DB: Delivery worker reads pending batch
      DB-->>S: Batch in model revision order
      S->>K: Publish operation batch
      K-->>S: Broker acknowledgment
      S->>DB: Mark published
      K-->>S: Consumer receives record
      S-->>A: OpsBroadcast
      S-->>B: OpsBroadcast
    end
    A->>A: Reconcile own accepted echo
    B->>B: Merge into local EMF projection
    Note over A,B: Acceptance and broadcast may arrive in either order.<br/>Advance applied revision after local application.
